<Base title={"The Music Paint Machine"} description={"This page shortly describes the Music Paint Machine, designed by Luc Nijs, postdoctoral researcher at IPEM (Ghent University)"} slug="mpm" bg="rgb(245, 245, 245)">
<section style="padding:47px 16px 22px"><div class="inner" style="max-width:980px">
<div class="b" style="margin-left:28.06%;width:43.78%"><div class="rt"><h2 class="ff-sans fs-28 c-27223e ta-center">THE MUSIC PAINT MACHINE</h2></div></div>
<div class="b" style="margin-left:44.18%;width:11.84%;margin-top:9px"><hr style="border-top:2px solid rgb(39, 34, 62)"></div>
</div></section>
<section style="padding:23px 16px 35px"><div class="inner" style="max-width:980px">
<div class="row" style="margin-left:8.47%;width:83.78%">
<div class="col" style="width:14.74%">
<div class="b" style=""><img src="/images/dce4d3_f9b44da68a9b4719b017d9b7a9d9612f.jpg" alt="Music Paint Machine" loading="lazy" style="aspect-ratio:121/80;object-fit:cover;border-radius:20px 20px 20px 20px"></div>
</div>
<div class="col" style="width:81.49%;margin-left:3.78%">
<div class="b" style="margin-top:4px"><div class="rt"><p class="ff-sans fs-14 c-27223e">This was my <strong>PhD</strong> project, in which I developed (with a team) and evaluated (user &amp; classroom study) an interactive educational technology that allows making a digital painting by moving while playing music.</p>
<p class="ff-sans fs-14 c-27223e">&nbsp;</p>
<p class="ff-sans fs-14 c-27223e">In 2012, my work with the Music Paint Machine was awarded the EAPRIL Best Research and Practice Award.</p>
<p class="ff-sans fs-14 c-27223e">&nbsp;</p>
<p class="ff-sans fs-14 c-27223e">Since 2010 and still ongoing, I have been touring with the Music Paint Machine in Europe, Canada, and the USA. While the soft- and hardware were not update, the MPM is still successful. I believe this stems from its strong pedagogical background.</p>
<p class="ff-sans fs-14 c-27223e">&nbsp;</p>
<p class="ff-sans fs-14 c-27223e"><strong><u>Keywords</u></strong>: musical creativity, bodily freedom, multimodal learning</p></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</div></section>
<section style="padding:35px 16px 89px"><div class="inner" style="max-width:980px">
<div class="b" style="margin-left:34.39%;width:31.02%"><div class="rt"><p class="ff-sans fs-14 c-27223e">Go to: <a href="http://www.musicpaintmachine.be" class="nou" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="c-3d9be9">www.musicpaintmachine.be</span></a></p></div></div>
</div></section>
</Base>
